# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# Ignore the built UI output, but KEEP the dist/ dir itself (via .gitkeep) so
# `//go:embed dist/*` in ui/embed.go resolves on a fresh clone before any
# `just ui` build — otherwise `just lint` / Go test compiles of internal/api
# fail with "pattern dist/*: no matching files found". The real vite build
# fills dist/ with the actual bundle.
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
